    "body": "## Problem\n\n`README.md` describes the app as it was before PRs #1–#3:\n- \"Dashboard with actual product counts and recent products\": the dashboard is now the single Workspace dashboard at `/` (`docs/plans/dashboard-cleanup.md`).\n- \"category/project/supplier/stage filters\" and \"Read-only live supplier links\": the product-level supplier became a Manufacturer (`GLOSSARY.md`: Manufacturer vs Supplier; ADR 0001).\n- Manufacturers & Quotes (directory, Quote Requests, Quotes, comparison, Sourcing panel) is not mentioned.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- \"Available workflows\" matches the app on `main`, using `GLOSSARY.md` terms (Workspace, Brand Profile, Tech Pack, Manufacturer, Quote Request, Quote). Check each claim against the code.\n- It says sourcing data is never in the share link, PDF or versions (ADR 0001).\n- Sections that are still true (Run, Brand Profile, AI, Storage and sharing, Checks, Known differences) stay, except for supplier → Manufacturer wording where it means the garment maker.\n- No code changes.\n",
